flowchart LR
    front[Front camera driver: planned] -->|side-by-side raw Image| frontcal[Calibration: front instance, implemented]
    yaml[(Measured calibration YAML)] -. read once .-> frontcal
    yaml -. read once .-> depth
    frontcal -->|left and right rectified Image| ml[Object detection: planned]
    frontcal -->|left and right rectified Image| hsv[Front color thresholding: planned]
    ml -->|per-class StereoObservation| depth[Depth estimation and source selection: implemented]
    hsv -->|per-class StereoObservation| depth
    depth -->|per-class map ObjectPosition| objects[Object positions in map]
    depth -. uncertainty and selected-source feedback .-> ml
    depth -. uncertainty and selected-source feedback .-> hsv
    bottom[Bottom camera driver: planned] --> bottomcal[Calibration: bottom instance, implemented]
    bottomyaml[(Measured bottom YAML)] -. read once .-> bottomcal
    bottomcal --> flow[Optical flow: planned]
    bottomcal --> bottomhsv[Bottom color localization: planned]
    sensors[IMU and pressure depth: planned bridge] --> ekf[EKF / localization and mapping: planned]
    flow -->|metric motion with scale and covariance| ekf
    ekf --> pose[Robot localization in map]
    ekf -->|timestamped camera TF| depth
    ekf -->|pose plus known plane or altitude required| bottomhsv
    bottomhsv --> bottomobjects[Bottom object positions in map]
